"""The "Scenario:" line of every A/R and A/P case (Rule 117 thirteenth amendment, QA lead 26 Oct 2026): one short, plain sentence
that opens the Preconditions and tells the manual tester the situation the test needs, in the shop's and the screen's words.
Written by hand for each case from what it tests and its existing preconditions (26 Oct 2026). No requirement codes, no placeholders,
no who-to-ask. ar_lib.C() attaches the line to the case by its key; build.py checks it."""
